:: Police Station
<<endevent>>
<<set $outside to 0>><<set $location to "police_station">><<effects>>
<<generatePolice 1>><<person1>>
You are stood in the police station lobby. A <<person>> in an officer's uniform sits behind the front desk.
<<if crimeSumCurrent() gte 5000>>
	There's a wanted poster behind <<him>>. <span class="red">It has a picture of your face.</span>
<</if>>
<br><br>
<<if $pleasure gte $pleasuremax>>
	<<orgasmLocation "policeStation">>
<</if>>
<<if $community_service gte 1 and $community_service_done isnot 1 and $exposed lte 0 and Time.hour lt 21 and Time.hour gte 6>>
	<<icon "community-service.png">><<link [[Community service (1:00)|Police Community]]>><</link>>
	<br>
<</if>>
<<if crimeSumCurrent() gte 1000>>
	<<skinicon "manacles">><<link [[Turn yourself in (1:00)|Police Turn]]>><<pass 6>><</link>><<note "You'll receive a more lenient sentence" "green">>
	<br>
<</if>>
<<if $worn.neck.collared is 1 or $worn.neck.name is "collar">>
	<<socialiseicon "ask">><<link [[Ask for collar removal|Police Station Collar]]>><</link>>
	<br>
<</if>>
<<if $worn.feet.type.includes("shackle") and $worn.feet.name isnot "vines">>
	<<crimeicon "shackles">><<link [[Ask for shackle removal|Police Station Shackle]]>><</link>>
	<br>
<</if>>
<<if $headdrive is 1 and $headpolice isnot 1>>
	<<techicon "usb">><<link [[Give evidence against Leighton|Police Leighton]]>><</link>>
	<br>
<</if>>
<br>
<<barbicon>><<link [[Leave|Barb Street]]>><<endevent>><</link>>
<br>

:: Police Turn
<<effects>>

<<generate2>><<generate3>>
You approach the desk.
<<speechresolve>>
<<if (_speechAttitudeResolved is "meek" or _speechAttitudeResolved is "shy")>>
	"I-I've been bad," you say. "I'm here to turn myself in."
<<elseif _speechAttitudeResolved is "docile">>
	You lower your eyes before you speak. "I've been bad. I'm here to turn myself in. I don't want to cause any more trouble."
<<elseif _speechAttitudeResolved is "polite">>
	"I'd like to turn myself in," you say. "I believe there's a warrant or record against me."
<<elseif _speechAttitudeResolved is "flamboyant">>
	You place both hands on the counter, taking care to sound composed. "I'd like to turn myself in."
<<elseif _speechAttitudeResolved is "confident">>
	"I'm here to turn myself in," you say. "You can check the records."
<<elseif (_speechAttitudeResolved is "bratty" or _speechAttitudeResolved is "cruel")>>
	"It's your lucky day," you say. "I'm here to turn myself in."
<<else>>
	"I'm a wanted criminal," you say. "I'm here to turn myself in."
<</if>>
<br><br>
<<if crimeSumCurrent() gte 5000>>
	The <<person>> frowns at you, then turns to the wanted poster behind <<him>>. <<He>> pulls it from the wall, and holds it over the desk. <<He>> compares you to the photo, as if suspecting a trick, then shrugs. <<He>> pushes a button below the desk, and two more officers enter.
	<br><br>
<<else>>
	The <<person>> frowns at you, then pushes a button below the desk. Two more officers enter.
	<br><br>
<</if>>
"Take <<phim>> to a cell," <<he>> says, still looking at you. "We'll soon decide what to do with you. Thank you for cooperating."
<br><br>

<<crimeDown 0.8 "all">>
You are led down a flight of steps, and into a tiny cell. The door rattles shut behind you.
<br><br>

<<link [[Next|Police Cell]]>><<endevent>><<pass 60>><</link>>
<br>

:: Police Station Collar

<<set $outside to 0>><<set $location to "police_station">><<effects>>
<<speechresolve>>
<<if (_speechAttitudeResolved is "meek" or _speechAttitudeResolved is "shy")>>
	You approach the desk, fingers at your collar. "C-Could you remove this, please?" you ask the <<person>>.
<<elseif _speechAttitudeResolved is "docile">>
	You wait until the <<person>> looks up before touching the collar at your throat. "Please... Could you remove this? I'll do whatever paperwork you need."
<<elseif (_speechAttitudeResolved is "polite" or _speechAttitudeResolved is "flamboyant")>>
	You approach the desk and indicate the collar. "Could you remove this for me, please?" you ask the <<person>>.
<<elseif _speechAttitudeResolved is "confident">>
	You step up to the desk and tap the collar at your throat. "I need this removed. What do you need from me?"
<<elseif _speechAttitudeResolved is "bratty">>
	You tug at your collar before addressing the <<person>>. "Are you going to get this thing off me, or just stare at it?"
<<elseif _speechAttitudeResolved is "cruel">>
	You hook a finger under the collar and glare across the desk. "Get this off me."
<<else>>
	You ask the <<person>> if you can have your collar removed.
<</if>>
<br><br>
<<if $worn.neck.collaredpolice and $community_service gte 1>>
	<span class="red">"No can do,"</span> <<he>> says. "That's part of your sentence. Finish your community service, then we'll remove it."
	<br><br>
	<<if hasSexStat("promiscuity", 2) and $daily.policeCollarSeduceAttempt isnot 1>>
		<<link [[Seduce|Police Station Seduce]]>><<set $daily.policeCollarSeduceAttempt to 1>><<set $phase to 1>><</link>><<promiscuous2>>
		<br>
	<</if>>
<<elseif $worn.neck.name is "familiar collar" and $worn.neck.cursed is 1>>
	"That doesn't look like one of ours. Give me a moment." <<He>> enters the lobby proper moments later. <<He>> feels it. "It's just fabric. This will only take a minute."
	<br><br>

	<<He>> produces a pair of scissors, and tries to cut the collar. The scissors slide away as they close, leaving not a mark. <<He>> scratches <<his>> head. "That's new."
	<br><br>

	<<He>> walks through a different door, and returns with a crowbar. "Hold still." <<He>> hooks the collar around the end, and tries wrenching it free. <<pain 2>><<gpain>>
	<br><br>

	<<He>> stops, but only after leaving a mark on your skin. "I don't know what kind of trick collar that is, but it's not coming off short of divine intervention. Sorry."
	<br><br>
<<else>>
	"Sure," <<he>> says. "It'll cost you, though. You really shouldn't go putting those things on for fun. They're government property for one thing, and a <<bitch>> to get off by design."
	<br><br>
	<<if hasSexStat("promiscuity", 2) and $daily.policeCollarSeduceAttempt isnot 1>>
		<<link [[Seduce|Police Station Seduce]]>><<set $daily.policeCollarSeduceAttempt to 1>><<set $phase to 0>><</link>><<promiscuous2>>
		<br>
	<</if>>
	<<if setup.inflation.canAfford(20000, "collarRemoval")>>
		<<link [[Pay up (<<printprice 20000>>)|Police Station Collar Removal]]>><<money -20000 "collarRemoval">><</link>>
		<br>
	<</if>>
<</if>>
<<link [[Leave|Police Station]]>><</link>>
<br>

:: Police Station Shackle

<<set $outside to 0>><<set $location to "police_station">><<effects>>
<<speechresolve>>
<<if (_speechAttitudeResolved is "meek" or _speechAttitudeResolved is "shy")>>
	You shuffle up to the desk and lift one ankle a bit. "C-Could you help me with these, please?"
<<elseif _speechAttitudeResolved is "docile">>
	You keep your voice low as you show the <<person>> your shackles. "Please... Is there anything you can do about these?"
<<elseif (_speechAttitudeResolved is "polite" or _speechAttitudeResolved is "flamboyant")>>
	You approach the desk and show the <<person>> your shackles. "Could you help me remove these, please?"
<<elseif _speechAttitudeResolved is "confident">>
	You step to the desk and let the chain clink against the floor. "I need these removed. Who handles that here?"
<<elseif _speechAttitudeResolved is "bratty">>
	You plant a foot where the <<person>> can see the shackle. "Any chance you lot can do something useful with these?"
<<elseif _speechAttitudeResolved is "cruel">>
	You plant a foot where the <<person>> can see the shackle. "Take these off. Or point me at someone competent."
<<else>>
	You ask the <<person>> if you can have your shackles removed.
<</if>>
<br><br>
"Dunno what you expect us to do," <<he>> laughs, looking at your ankles. "These aren't the Middle Ages." <<He>> laughs again. <span class="gold">"Try a museum."</span>
<br><br>

<<link [[Leave|Police Station]]>><</link>>
<br>

:: Police Station Seduce

<<set $outside to 0>><<set $location to "police_station">><<effects>>
<<if $phase is 1>>
